    {
      "heading": "The questions people actually ask",
      "body": {
        "type": "root",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "p",
            "id": "McDlazlAHB",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "id": "El6krGFaQc",
                "text": "Nobody buying a block asks about brand values. They ask what it costs to get out of the ground, whether it is on sewer, how far the beach really is, and how long the drive to Launceston takes. We listed every one of those questions with the developers and built the page around the answers. The FAQ is not a footnote here, it is most of the argument."
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
